1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:05,060
(Sheldon:)Hold on. If you don't want to live
with Leonard, why don't you just tell him?

2
00:00:05,262 --> 00:00:07,962
(Penny:)Well, you know how he is.
He's sensitive and emotional.

3
00:00:08,198 --> 00:00:10,668
(Sheldon:)That's because he drinks
too much soy milk.

4
00:00:12,235 --> 00:00:14,865
(Penny:)I don't know what else
we can do but tell them the truth.

5
00:00:15,272 --> 00:00:17,902
(Sheldon:)I suppose there's no choice
but to face the crying...

6
00:00:18,108 --> 00:00:22,168
(Sheldon:)...angry accusations,
and the high-pitched wails of despair.

7
00:00:22,379 --> 00:00:25,409
(Penny:)Yeah. And who knows
how Amy will react.

8
00:00:29,619 --> 00:00:30,779
(Howard:)Here's some more ice.

9
00:00:31,621 --> 00:00:34,491
(Sheldon:)- Thanks.
- What were we thinking?

10
00:00:34,724 --> 00:00:37,424
(Howard:)We should have just done it
the regular way.

11
00:00:38,295 --> 00:00:42,755
(Bernadette:)Those Chinese acrobats in Cirque Du Soleil
made it look so easy.

12
00:00:43,934 --> 00:00:47,704
(Howard:)Honestly, if I could bend that far,
what would I need with you?

13
00:00:50,240 --> 00:01:01,020
(Bernadette:)If you could bend that far,
you'd be doing us both a favor.

